Package: xinbot-box-manager
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: newPlayerAL <200553324+newPlayerAL@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: adduser, libc6, libgcc-s1, default-jre-headless (>= 2:1.17) | openjdk-17-jre-headless | java17-runtime-headless
Homepage: https://github.com/newPlayerAL/xinbot-box-manager
Description: web manager and bundled runtime for XinBot instances
 XinBot Box Manager provides a browser-based interface for configuring and
 running multiple isolated XinBot instances on a headless Linux host.
 The package bundles XinBot Core, XinMetaPlugin, BackToTheBase and MovementSync.
